  "body": "Positioned on an exceptional 4,889 sq m (more or less) freehold peninsula, this tightly held waterfront estate enjoys a truly private setting, surrounded by the Hauraki Gulf on three sides and commanding breathtaking 270-degree panoramic sea views. \r\n\r\nThe substantially constructed mid-century residence offers five bedrooms, multiple living areas, and two bathrooms, providing generous accommodation for family living and entertaining. Almost every room enjoys stunning sea views, while expansive patios, a swimming pool, games room, and gym combine to create an exceptional waterfront lifestyle. \r\n\r\nWhether you choose to enjoy the home as it stands, renovate and modernise, or explore its longer-term potential, the scale, privacy, and unrivalled coastal position create a rare opportunity to secure one of the North Shore's most significant waterfront landholdings.\r\n\r\nThe vendors have long since moved on and the instruction is clear that this property will be sold.",
